/*

        Name:           Stu
        Location:
        Description:    She is spiritually lost and the drugs have not eased her soul.
She has a strength of 5, which has come from her repair work. To successfully intimidate her requires a male to have a strength of 8 (or melee of 130)  and a female to have strength of 7 (or melee of 120). To successfully convince her requires a minimum speech skill of 77.

           Created: 07/10/2020 18:04:10

*/

